CREATED:20231016T184222Z
DESCRIPTION:In a rare change of approach to children\, Katie Williams an
 d Sophie McConville formally invite your little people to a Halloween ba
 sh of spectacular proportions. You will enter a haunted hallway full of 
 ghouls and monsters greeted by vikings before entering the formal party 
 area by the witches themselves where you will be taught to mix potions\,
  dance like demons and solve wizardly puzzles. Some light refreshments a
 nd snacks will be provided. Halloween dress is mandatory (yes that inclu
 des parents). A separate adults only evening mixer invite will follow in
  due course. 
