BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20241010T100624Z
DESCRIPTION:Event:\nAS & A Level Music Technology - Launch Event (Live O
 nline Event)\nhttps://booktraining.pearson.com/courses/1419-as-a-level-m
 usic-technology-launch-event-live-online-event\n\nSpecial Instructions:\
 nThese online events are for teachers of AS and A level Music Technology
  who want to find out more about the benefits of offering our new specif
 ication for first teaching from September 2017.Delegates will learn abou
 t the following:- The reforms to the qualification - The structure and c
 ontent of our new specification- Changes to the assessment of our qualif
 ication- The wide range of support we're providing to help you make the 
 transitionThis event can count as 2 hours of CPD. Launch events may be b
 ased on draft materials which are subject to change as we go through the
  accreditation process. We will give you the most up to date information
  available in our training events.\n\n\nIf you require further informati
 on or support regarding this registration\, please feel free to contact 
